# Random modules of types whose layouts span the kinds and the primary
# tags' boundaries, which print, switch on, unify and take apart static and
# allocated values of them (see utils/codegen-oracle/generate-layout-programs.py):
# merkc's programs, at -O0 and -O2, and with heap chunks of 64 bytes, print
# what mmc's print. The seed is fixed, so the modules are too; to search
# further, run generate-layout-programs.py with other seeds.
#
# REQUIRES: mmc
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir %t
# RUN: %python %S/../../../utils/codegen-oracle/generate-layout-programs.py --seed 1 --count 20 %t
# RUN: %compare-runs --levels 0 2 --chunk-bytes 64 --jobs 4 %t/*.m
